<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Home page</title>
  <style>
        body {
      margin: 0;
      padding-top: 96px; /* 90px height + 6px top offset */
    }
    .main{
      height:90px;
      width:100%;
      background-color: #177fda; /* Alice Blue */
      position: fixed;
      top:6px;
      z-index: 6;
    }
    h1{
      font-size: 40px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-shadow: 2px 1px 0px 0px solid #B0E0E6;
      text-align: center;
      color:white;
      margin:20px;
    }
    h2{
      font-size: 50px;
      color: black;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
      margin:16px;
    }
    p{
      font-size: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 0;
      margin-left: 20px;
      color:grey;
    }
    a{
text-decoration: none;
text-align: center;
    }
    .btn{
      height:70px;
      width:100%;
      gap:20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      
    }
    a.bt{
      height:40px;
      min-width:150px;
      background-color: #dcdcdc;
      color:black;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 5px;
      border: none;
      margin: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: 1s ease-in;
    }
    a.bt:hover{
    background-color: #B0E0E6;
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="main">
<h1> My EJS Project </h1>
</div>
<h2> Welcome to EJS  </h2>
<p>EJS (Embedded JavaScript) ek templating engine hai jo JavaScript ka use karke Html pages ko dynamically generate karne ke liye istemal ki jaati hai. <br>Iska upyog web development mein hota hai, khaaskar Node.js aur Express.js ke sath. <br>Ejs Html ke andar JavaScript ko embed karne ki suvidha deta hai, jisse aap real-time data ko Html pages mein dikhane ke liye loops,  conditions, aur variables ka upyog kar sakte hain. </p>
<div class="btn">
  <%buttons.forEach(function(btn) { %>
     <a class="bt" href="<%= btn.route %>"><%= btn.label %></a>
  <% }); %>
</div>
</body>
</html>
